            <p class="text-muted">
                Demonstrates enterprise state management using <strong>Distributed Memory Caching</strong> and the <strong>Post-Redirect-Get (PRG)</strong> pattern without premature database persistence:
            </p>

            <div class="row g-3 mt-2">
                <div class="col-md-4">
