                        <div class="fw-bold text-primary mb-1">Step 3: Parts & Sign-Off</div>
                        <p class="small text-muted mb-0">Maintains a session cart of reserved spare parts, captures digital technician badge sign-off, and executes an atomic DB commit.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
