    <!-- 5. DB & Stored Procedures Tab -->
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="db">
        <div class="card p-4">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark border-bottom pb-2">Database Architecture & Stored Procedures</h5>
            <p class="text-muted">
                Maintained in <code>D:\Anubhaw\Projects\DB\Enterprise CMMS DB.sql</code> under the <strong>`Projects`</strong> schema.
            </p>

            <h6 class="fw-bold mt-3">The 5 Production Stored Procedures</h6>
            <ul class="small text-muted">
                <li><code>Projects.sp_CreateWorkOrder</code>: Transactional creation with auto-generated formatted WO number (<code>WO-YYYY-XXXXX</code>) and initial audit log.</li>
                <li><code>Projects.sp_ApproveWorkOrder</code>: Managerial authorization, status change, and asset status locking.</li>
                <li><code>Projects.sp_AllocateSparePart</code>: Atomic inventory deduction with <code>UPDLOCK</code> row locking to prevent race conditions.</li>
                <li><code>Projects.sp_GetAssetMaintenanceSummary</code>: KPI metrics, total orders, completed orders, downtime hours, and spare parts costs.</li>
                <li><code>Projects.sp_RotateRefreshToken</code>: Cryptographic JWT refresh token rotation with replay attack detection.</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- 6. Resume Highlights Tab -->
    <div class="tab-pane fade" id="resume">
        <div class="card p-4">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark border-bottom pb-2">Ready-To-Use Resume Bullet Points</h5>
            <div class="bg-light p-3 rounded font-monospace small mb-3">
                <strong>Enterprise Asset & Maintenance Management System (ApexCMMS)</strong><br />
                <em>Tech Stack: ASP.NET Core 10/9 MVC, C#, EF Core, SQL Server, Identity, JWT, Redis/Distributed Session</em><br /><br />
                • Architected a multi-tier solution adhering to Clean Architecture principles separating Domain, Application, Infrastructure, and Presentation layers.<br />
                • Implemented hybrid security combining ASP.NET Core Identity cookie-based auth for Razor MVC and HMAC-SHA256 JWT bearer tokens with refresh token rotation for mobile REST APIs.<br />
                • Built granular Claims- and Policy-based RBAC enforcing department-level data isolation across 4 distinct enterprise user roles.<br />
                • Managed stateful workflows using Distributed Session caching for a 3-step diagnostic inspection wizard and parts reservation cart.<br />
                • Prevented data race conditions utilizing EF Core Optimistic Concurrency Control (RowVersion) and built an automated ChangeTracker audit trail recording JSON property diffs for every state mutation.<br />
                • Authored transactional T-SQL Stored Procedures in a custom Projects database schema for high-throughput work order creation, row-locked inventory deduction, and token rotation.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
